===Format===
* '''''Playins:'''''
** 8 teams in a GSL double-elimination bracket format. 
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4}} teams qualify to the '''Swiss Stage'''.
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-playin-seeding" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for playin stage seeding''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-playin-seeding" style="width:760px; margin-left:45px">
#[[Europe_MENA_League/2026/Kickoff|EML Kickoff]] Seed 4 
#[[North_America_League/2026/Kickoff|NAL Kickoff]] Seed 4 
#[[South_America_League/2026/Kickoff|SAL Kickoff]] Seed 4 
#[[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/Oceania|Oceania]] Seed 1
#[[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/Asia|Asia]] Seed 2
#[[CN_League/2026/Kickoff|CNL Kickoff]] Seed 2 
#[[CN_League/2026/Kickoff|CNL Kickoff]] Seed 3 
#[[CN_League/2026/Kickoff|CNL Kickoff]] Seed 4
*Each APL subregion qualifies 1 team with the best placing APL subregion at previous events receives an extra spot. For the Salt Lake City Major [[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/Asia|Asia]] receives the extra spot.
*The APL subregions qualifying teams to Phase 2 will be decided based on previous international event results. For the Salt Lake City Major [[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/Asia|Asia]] and [[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/APAC North|APAC North]] qualifies their first seeds to Phase 2.</div>

* '''''Swiss Stage:'''''
** 16 teams competing in a Swiss format.
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 8}} teams qualify to the '''Playoffs'''.
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-swiss-seeding" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for swiss stage seeding''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-swiss-seeding" style="width:760px; margin-left:45px">
*Seeds 1-4: [[Europe_MENA_League/2026/Kickoff|EML Seed 1]], [[North_America_League/2026/Kickoff|NAL Seed 1]], [[South_America_League/2026/Kickoff|SAL Seed 1]], [[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/Asia|Asia Seed 1]]
*Seeds 5-8: [[Europe_MENA_League/2026/Kickoff|EML Seed 2]], [[North_America_League/2026/Kickoff|NAL Seed 2]], [[South_America_League/2026/Kickoff|SAL Seed 2]], [[Asia_Pacific_League/2026/Kickoff/APAC North|APAC North Seed 1]]
*Seeds 9-12: [[Europe_MENA_League/2026/Kickoff|EML Seed 3]], [[North_America_League/2026/Kickoff|NAL Seed 3]], [[South_America_League/2026/Kickoff|SAL Seed 3]], [[CN_League/2026/Kickoff|CNL Seed 1]]
*Seeds 13-14: Teams qualifying from Playins upper bracket
*Seeds 15-16: Teams qualifying from Playins lower bracket</div>
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-swiss-tiebreakers" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for swiss stage tiebreakers''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-swiss-tiebreakers" style="width:760px; margin-left:45px">
